			"notes": "Client-side Fabric mod for **Minecraft 26.1.2**.\n\n**Install:** download `golemaddons-0.1.10.jar` below and put it in your mods folder, replacing any older GolemAddons jar. Needs Fabric Loader 0.20.1+ and Fabric API. Mod Menu is optional.\n\n### Fixed\n- **More robust auto-updater.** It now replaces the jar the mod was actually loaded from, in whatever folder and under whatever name, on any launcher (plain mods folder, Lunar, Prism, Modrinth, ...).\n- **Windows:** the update finishes after the game closes, retrying while the old jar is still locked, without a console window popping up.\n- An update that couldn't finish is retried automatically the next time the game closes.\n- Every step is written to `golemaddons-update.log` next to the mod jar, to see what happened if an update doesn't go through.\n\nIf auto-update didn't work for you before, install this version by hand once; updates after it use the new updater."
		},
