			"notes": "Client-side Fabric mod for **Minecraft 26.1.2**.\n\n**Install:** download `golemaddons-0.1.9.jar` below and put it in your mods folder, replacing any older GolemAddons jar. Needs Fabric Loader 0.20.1+ and Fabric API. Mod Menu is optional. On 0.1.8 you can also update from the game: Updates → Install.\n\n### Changed\n- New installs use **Upgrades Shop** as the sell screen title, so selling works without setting it first.\n- The **Quick sell** key is **I** by default.\n\nSettings and key bindings you already have are kept."
