			"notes": "Client-side Fabric mod for **Minecraft 26.1.2**.\n\n**Install:** download `golemaddons-0.1.8.jar` below and put it in your mods folder, replacing any older GolemAddons jar. Needs Fabric Loader 0.20.1+ and Fabric API. Mod Menu is optional.\n\n### Fixed\n- **Auto-updater on Lunar Client:** Install now works when the mod sits in a folder inside `mods` (Lunar uses `mods/fabric-26.1.2/`). The update is installed next to the running jar.\n- Installing an update also removes older GolemAddons jars left in the same folder, so only one copy loads.\n- Release notes in the Updates screen are shown formatted instead of as raw Markdown.\n\nIf you're on 0.1.7 or older in Lunar, install this one by hand once; after that, updates install from the game."
